# Build the full platform frontend (mock-first)

## Mission

Evolve the existing React frontend in `frontend/` into the complete UI for our AI test-automation platform. The backend for the new features does not exist yet — every new capability must work end-to-end against mock clients that simulate real behavior, and must be swappable to real HTTP clients later by flipping `VITE_USE_BACKEND=1`, with zero component changes. The mock layer you build IS the API contract we will implement on the backend, so design it as carefully as production code.

